  m_text: PARAAA POOO is a 2D endless runner where you automatically pilot a jeepney
    across two road layers (upper/lower). Tap to instantly switch layers to navigate
    gaps and collect passengers for score. Survive as long as possible as the speed
    continuously increases. The game ends immediately if the jeepney falls into a
    gap. The visual style features colorful, Philippine-inspired city streets.
